  "policy": "Administrative-title veto on name/native before all four identity gates. All four gates required. AU SAL 2021 polygon/code/count; MX active INEGI locality P1976 and 2020 ITER; US 2020 Census place P774/GEOID or P590/ANSI, existing #2254 LSAD classes. QLever discovery only; live literal wbgetentities <=50, >=2 seconds, maxlag=5. Ownership scan includes every contribution JSON table in every country. Held rows and paired owners unchanged. Same-place item correction is an ordinary field change; classification event only for changes to type/type_local/level.",
